PASS  only strictly-improving children enter the archive   | archive = [0, 1, 3]; node 2 (dU = -0.02) is excluded
PASS  but a NON-archived node still contributes as an inspiration   | node 2 inspired node 3 despite regressing
PASS  persisting the whole graph is what allows revisiting a deprioritised lineage   | a fixed-size beam would have discarded node 2 and lost that option
