PASS  the branch state is exactly (s, m, h)
PASS  all five components governed the iteration   | psi/sigma/alpha/pi drive the steps; epsilon executes the chosen edit
PASS  the task skill changed   | {'retries': 1, 'verify': 0} -> {'retries': 0, 'verify': 0}
PASS  and the history grew by exactly one iteration
PASS  the SAME pipeline edits the meta-skill   | {'psi_sensitivity': 0.8, 'sigma_k': 2, 'alpha_budget': 3, 'pi_step': 1} -> {'psi_sensitivity': 0.8, 'sigma_k': 2, 'alpha_budget': 4, 'pi_step': 1}
PASS  no second mechanism was written to do it   | one five_step function served both timescales — that is what eq. 2's shared format buys
```

