PASS  averaging only ARCHIVED children is biased upward at every true P   | the archive gate (dU > 0) truncates the distribution before you average it
PASS  worst case: a HARMFUL meta-skill looks productive   | true P = -0.020 but archive-only estimate = +0.0334 — it would be selected and spread
